      <title>An active and informed citizenry — and respect for local law enforcement</title>
      <link>https://www.sequimgazette.com/2026/02/25/an-active-and-informed-citizenry-and-respect-for-local-law-enforcement/</link>
      <description>The nation witnessed the death of two of our fellow citizens in Minneapolis last month. Their deaths, roughly two weeks apart, happened in the days just prior to our regular city council meetings. I grappled with a decision of whether or not to speak to these events from the privilege of my seat on the council, and if I were to speak, what words would be appropriate.</description>
